#: page.ttsengines.php:32
msgid ""
"On this page you can manage text to speech engines on your system. When you "
"add an engine you give it a name, and the full path to the engine on your "
"system. After doing this the engine will be available on the text to speech "
"page."
msgstr "在此頁面您可以管理系統上的文字轉語音引擎。新增引擎時，為其命名並提供系統上該引擎的完整路徑。完成後，此引擎即可在文字轉語音頁面使用。"

#: views/grid.php:10
#: views/rnav.php:15
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路徑"

#: assets/js/ttsengines.js:36
msgid "Please enter a valid Engine Name."
msgstr "請輸入有效的引擎名稱。"

#: assets/js/ttsengines.js:28
msgid "Please enter a valid Engine Path."
msgstr "請輸入有效的引擎路徑。"

#: Ttsengines.class.php:35
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重設"

#: ttsengines.i18n.php:6
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

#: Ttsengines.class.php:40
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "送出"

#: ttsengines.i18n.php:4
#: ttsengines.i18n.php:10
msgid "Text To Speech Engines"
msgstr "文字轉語音引擎"

#: page.ttsengines.php:33
msgid "Text to Speech Engines"
msgstr "文字轉語音引擎"

#: views/form.php:93
msgid ""
"The full path to the binary of your text to speech engine. For example: /usr/"
"sbin/magic_speech_engine."
msgstr "您的文字轉語音引擎二進位檔的完整路徑。例如：/usr/sbin/magic_speech_engine。"

#: views/form.php:69
msgid ""
"The name you enter will be shown in a drop down box on the Text to Speech "
"page so you can select which engine you want to play your text."
msgstr "您輸入的名稱將顯示在「文字轉語音」頁面的下拉式選單中，方便您選擇要用哪個引擎播放您的文字。"
